        "id": 34175,
        "name": "Riffian",
        "username": "Riffian",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-04T15:33:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dawn’s setup says to bring the first three citizens into play. Like awp said, Dare doesn’t count - so treat him as if you’d just drawn an ongoing from the deck or something. Ongoings wouldn’t come out during setup, so Dare doesn’t either.<br>\nAlso, from what I’ve seen, drawing a different Citizen is likely to make the start of the game a lot easier on you… unless you’re out to have a harder game on purpose <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:08:07.171Z",
